# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo regardless of what OS/editor
# checks a file out or saves it — without this, Windows tools (editors,
# other AI assistants, etc.) silently re-save files as CRLF, which then
# shows up as a full-file diff with zero actual content change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git should never try to diff or convert line endings on.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.svg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.db binary
